  "description": "XOFKOW crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C132 H145 Al9 N27 O79 Pr7 2+,1.5(C5 H5 N1),5.5(C2 H3 N1),2(N1 O3 1-). From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr3 (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr1A (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2A (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr1B (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2B (Pr) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.902-3.902 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.99-102.52°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150.5H169Al9Pr7N36O85.",
